WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Tiled windows share the available workspace

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Super + V or Restore returns a window to floating

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Tile joins it back to the shared layout

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Workspace forcing can override an app’s preferred mode

